# For local noSandbox runs nothing here is required:
#   - pi auth comes from ~/.pi/agent/auth.json (provider: zai)
#   - gh auth comes from your normal gh login
# Copy to .sandcastle/.env only if you need to override something.
#
# GitHub token for the agent's gh calls (falls back to your gh login on the host;
# on GitHub Actions the workflow injects GITHUB_TOKEN automatically).
GH_TOKEN=
